  "brief_en": "Study website/index.html, website.png and product.json. Create a 25-second launch video for Waypoint, a fictional collaborative travel planner. Choose a clear story from problem to product to action. Reuse its identity and real supplied feature claims. Show at least two actual UI ideas from the source. End with \"Plan together. Go further.\" and \"waypoint.example\". The HTML is a frozen input, not a video solution.",
